LAMMPS (29 Sep 2021 - Update 2)
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread. (src/comm.cpp:98)
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
# Анализ водородных связей в системе воды TIP4P

# Инициализация
units real
atom_style full
boundary p p p

pair_style lj/cut/tip4p/long 1 2 1 1 0.1546 12
kspace_style pppm/tip4p 1.0e-4

bond_style harmonic
angle_style harmonic

# Загрузка последней конфигурации
read_data tip4p-NPT.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (4.0952388 4.0952388 4.0952388) to (35.104760 35.104760 35.104760)
  2 by 2 by 2 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  3000 atoms
  reading velocities ...
  3000 velocities
  scanning bonds ...
  2 = max bonds/atom
  scanning angles ...
  1 = max angles/atom
  reading bonds ...
  2000 bonds
  reading angles ...
  1000 angles
Finding 1-2 1-3 1-4 neighbors ...
  special bond factors lj:    0        0        0       
  special bond factors coul:  0        0        0       
     2 = max # of 1-2 neighbors
     1 = max # of 1-3 neighbors
     1 = max # of 1-4 neighbors
     2 = max # of special neighbors
  special bonds CPU = 0.001 seconds
  read_data CPU = 0.058 seconds

# Восстановление силового поля (как в предыдущих расчетах)
pair_coeff      1 1 0.18521 3.1589 # O-O
pair_coeff      2 2 0.0    0.0     # H-H
pair_coeff      1 2 0.0    0.0     # O-H
pair_modify     tail yes

bond_coeff      1 1000.0 0.9572    # O-H
angle_coeff     1 100.0 104.52     # H-O-H

# Группировка атомов
group gH2O type 1 2
3000 atoms in group gH2O
group oxygen type 1
1000 atoms in group oxygen
group hydrogen type 2
2000 atoms in group hydrogen

# Параметры анализа H-связей
variable max_OO_dist equal 3.5    # максимальное расстояние O-O
variable min_angle equal 150      # минимальный угол O-H...O

# 1. Создание соседних списков для анализа
compute nbO oxygen neigh/atom cut ${max_OO_dist}
compute nbO oxygen neigh/atom cut 3.5
ERROR: Unrecognized compute style 'neigh/atom' (src/modify.cpp:1265)
Last command: compute nbO oxygen neigh/atom cut ${max_OO_dist}
